{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50018","headline":"句 · 庄翱","name":"句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天外夜深风渐远，高松长似水流声。\n焚香暮入飜花殿，净手秋开贝叶经。\n野性本怜松下月，幽情唯爱洞中春。\n殷懃笑喻人间事，遥指庭花对夕阳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"庄翱","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50018.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50018","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}